  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "The Salty Pearl by Oversee 30A | Perfect in Walton County Awards – Three-Time Diamond Winner – Best Rental Mgmt. 2026, 2025, 2024<br> <br>Welcome to The Salty Pearl, an incredible 30A sanctuary, in the heart of Dune Allen Beach. This gorgeous coastal home is all about relaxation and fun, with a jaw-dropping outdoor deck space featuring a private pool, comfy loungers, and a gas grill for your BBQ nights.<br><br>Highlights:<br>📍 Dune Allen Beach<br>🏝️ 0.2 miles to Dune Allen Regional Beach Access<br>🛌 6 bedrooms, 5 baths<br>👙 Gorgeous private pool, hot tub, grill, loungers, outdoor oasis!<br>🍹 Wet bar<br>🚲 5 bikes!<br>🦞 5-star restaurants<br>🍦 Fun and yummy shops<br> <br>Jarrod (GUEST REVIEW/AUGUST 2025)<br>“Absolutely amazing house with a plethora of amenities! Went with 4 families, all were extremely comfortable and had privacy. Quick walk to the beach and the pool/spa and backyard setup was great! Absolutely nothing to whine about and Cari with Oversee was super! The bikes provided were a great time and coming back to this exact house is a 100% guarantee! Been coming to 30A for 20 years and this is the best spot hands down!”<br><br>Step onto the main floor of this beautiful 3-story home, where the front room is bright and welcoming with stylish furnishings, coastal décor, and lots of natural light. With a large TV and a wet bar nearby, the vibe is chill, a perfect space for entertaining. But the best is yet to come…<br><br>This unique living area opens directly to the backyard pool and hot tub, creating a lovely indoor/outdoor entertainment paradise and hangout zone. Just steps away, there’s even a convenient pool bathroom with an exterior door. No wet footprints through the house.<br><br>Also on this floor: a spacious kids' bunkroom with 8 twin beds, and two guest rooms, each featuring a queen bed, smart TV, private patio, and its own sliding glass door. There’s also a set of double washers and dryers on this level to keep beach towels and swimsuits fresh all week.<br><br>On the second floor, the main living, dining, and kitchen area features a large traditional dining table with bench seating for 8–10, plus 4 bar stools at the breakfast bar. The gourmet kitchen includes an island with a built-in microwave and is fully stocked and features a mixer, Ninja blender, air fryer, and all the essentials for a home-cooked seafood boil or laid-back taco night.<br><br>Just off the kitchen, a screened-in front balcony with ceiling fans makes for a perfect bug-free space to sip coffee or gather over happy hour. Around the corner, another balcony with two picnic tables overlooks the pool below.<br><br>Down the hall are two more bedrooms, one with a king bed and private ensuite bathroom, and the other with a queen bed. Both have TVs and access to a cozy second-floor living space with a large TV, ideal for movie nights.<br>The third floor is all about privacy and Gulf views. The primary suite features a king bed, private bathroom, and another screened-in balcony.<br><br>Roomy parking fits 4 vehicles, and the 5 bikes are a blast. For beach days, just head south on Hilltop Drive toward 30A and take a left—the public beach access is right there.<br><br>After a day in the waves, head back to The Salty Pearl, grab a drink from the wet bar, and kick back by the pool. Sounds dreamy, doesn’t it? With Oversee 30A as your host, the answer is yes.<br><br>Overview:<br>- 3,500 square footage <br>- 0.2 miles to beach (Dune Allen Regional Beach Access) <br>- 6 bedroom, 5 bath<br>- Private pool<br>- Hot tub<br>- 5 adult bikes<br>- Propane grill<br> <br>Overnight: (Sleeps 18)<br>FIRST FLOOR<br>- Bunkroom: Four twin-over-twin bunks<br>- Guest Room: Queen bed<br>- Guest Room: Queen bed<br>*All rooms on this floor share 2 hallway bathrooms with showers only.* <br>SECOND FLOOR<br>- Guest Room: King bed, private bath with shower only.<br>- Guest Room: Queen bed, shared bath with shower/tub combo <br>THIRD FLOOR<br>- Primary Bedroom: King bed, private bathroom with shower only<br> <br>Check-in is 4:00 PM CST. Check-out is 10:00 AM CST.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "PRIVATE POOL & RELAXING SPA! Bikes!"
        }
